"source": "the program folders of the Zyxel NAS326 firmware V5.21(AAZF.18)C0 (download.zyxel.com/NAS326/firmware/NAS326_V5.21(AAZF.18)C0.zip; path: link target or size), listed 2026-10-21 in two steps: the system image sysdisk.img (ext2) dumped with debugfs rdump and the initramfs (the cpio in the kernel) unpacked, both in a container, then their folders listed with python3 -I (names, link targets, sizes; nothing of the image run). bin and sbin are those of the initramfs with bin and sbin of the system image copied over them, usr/bin, usr/sbin, usr/local/bin and usr/local/sbin those of the system image, which /etc/init.d/rcS of the initramfs mounts on /usr (cp -a /ram_bin/bin/* /bin/, cp -a /ram_bin/sbin/* /sbin/, mount --bind /ram_bin/usr /usr); firmware/sbin and firmware/htp those of the initramfs (the folders of the PATH of its /etc/profile). Left out: links whose target is in none of these folders (bin/zysh -> /sbin/zyshclient). V5.21(AAZF.14)C0: the bin and sbin of its initramfs have the same names, one size differs (releases); its system image was not listed, its programs are those of AAZF.18 (unverified)",
